{"id":"fa_cil","lemma":"fácil","pos":"adj","rank":343,"glosses":["easy, facile, simple (requiring little effort)","easy-to-use, user-friendly (clipping of fácil de usar)","easy (being readily available for sex)"],"ipa":"/ˈfaθil/","forms":{"femininePlural":"fáciles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-f%C3%A1cil.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Eso fue muy fácil!","en":"That was very easy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450588","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null]},{"text":"Estas preguntas son fáciles de responder.","en":"These questions are easy to answer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568167","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"question","l":"pregunta"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to answer, to reply"}]},{"text":"Tu trabajo no es fácil.","en":"Your job isn't easy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453721","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"work, job"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"El francés no me resulta fácil.","en":"French isn't easy for me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302540","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"French"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to result","l":"resultar"},null]},{"text":"No hay respuestas fáciles.","en":"There are no easy answers.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"reply","l":"respuesta"},null]}]}